# Normalize line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF,
# regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with autocrlf=true materializes CRLF and biome's formatter (LF-only)
# reports every file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binaries — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
